 "notes": "Dive park at the pavilion on the north-west shore of the Groene Heuvels: the entry beside the pavilion jetty (diving from the jetty itself is not allowed), the guide lines, the surface buoys and the objects, with depths between the 5, 10, 15 and 20 m contours; the 23 m deep platform, the 7 m cage and the two wrecks near 10 m follow duikspotter.nl and duiken.nl. Drawn north up; positions are approximate to a few tens of metres. The OpenStreetMap dive node and today's Scuba Services entry at parking B on the north-east shore are not drawn. Shoreline from OpenStreetMap (© OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL).",
